!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = 1000 ng per sample was processed using the NEBNext Ultra II Directional RNA Library Prep Kit for Illumina (New England Biolabs, E7760L) and included polyA-enrichment using NEBNext Poly(A) mRNA Magnetic Isolation Module (New England Biolabs, E7490L), fragmentation for 15 minutes at 94°C prior to first strand synthesis, and 8 cycles of amplification after adapter ligation.
!Sample_data_processing = FASTQ files were first filtered using a bespoke Perl script to remove reads shorter than 36bp.
!Sample_data_processing = Filtered FASTQ files were aligned to Gencode M12 gene annotations and mm10 genome build using the STAR short-read aligner (v2.6.0a)
!Sample_data_processing = Read count files generated by STAR were merged with gene annotations in R
